        "id": 224199,
        "name": "The Mariner",
        "username": "The_Mariner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_mariner/{size}/2025_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-11-23T15:40:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Voss enjoys listening to music from the worlds he's conquered, but has established the lie of a&nbsp;\"Court Musician\" so that he can claim that they're all more examples of Thorathian ingenuity.</p>\n<p>As much as Glamour hates the Freedom Five, she has a personal illusion, just for herself- she sees the other (real) Slaughterhouse Six villains as the other members of the Golden Age Freedom Five.</p>\n<p>Blood Countess Bathory thinks that Fanatic changed her hair to match&nbsp;<em>her</em>. &nbsp;Fanatic thinks that Bathory does her hair to match&nbsp;<em>her</em>. &nbsp;Nobody knows the truth.</p>\n<p>Chrono-Ranger is very confused at why Citizen Anvil keeps talking about his butt. &nbsp;Also, he mixes up Hammer and Anvil.</p>\n<p>Wager Master has been able to break the fourth wall ever since his first fight with Guise. &nbsp;He's just sitting on it, because once you let that cat out of the bag it becomes most of your bit.</p>\n<p>Unity has nightmares about wotld domination.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:57:32.306Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
