        "raw": "<p>Voss enjoys listening to music from the worlds he's conquered, but has established the lie of a&nbsp;\"Court Musician\" so that he can claim that they're all more examples of Thorathian ingenuity.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>As much as Glamour hates the Freedom Five, she has a personal illusion, just for herself- she sees the other (real) Slaughterhouse Six villains as the other members of the Golden Age Freedom Five.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Blood Countess Bathory thinks that Fanatic changed her hair to match&nbsp;<em>her</em>. &nbsp;Fanatic thinks that Bathory does her hair to match&nbsp;<em>her</em>. &nbsp;Nobody knows the truth.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chrono-Ranger is very confused at why Citizen Anvil keeps talking about his butt. &nbsp;Also, he mixes up Hammer and Anvil.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Wager Master has been able to break the fourth wall ever since his first fight with Guise. &nbsp;He's just sitting on it, because once you let that cat out of the bag it becomes most of your bit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unity has nightmares about wotld domination.</p>",
